+This is a markdown file with embedded Svelte content. Prettier can format this
+by offloading the formatting of the fenced code block to prettier-plugin-svelte.
+
+```svelte
+<script context="module">
+    const greeting = "Hello";
+</script>
+
+<script>
+    const name = "world";
+</script>
+
+<h1>{greeting}, {name}!</h1>
+
+<style>
+    h1 {
+        color: green;
+    }
+</style>
+
+```
